{"id":"4875436f4c986c7f","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-essential-geometric-morphisms.md","title":"Definition — 本质几何态射","display":"Definition — 本质几何态射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-essential-geometric-morphisms","aliases":["14-df-essential-geometric-morphisms"],"display":"Definition — 本质几何态射","depends_on":["[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-functor]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-essential-geometric-morphisms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-essential-geometric-morphisms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 本质几何态射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a> 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsEssential}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\ (\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(L,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(L,f^*)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsEssential}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\ (\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(L,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(L,f^*)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 VII 讨论 essential geometric morphisms。仅存在 f_!⊣f* 的旧<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"afcd93ebfca63623\" href=\"?note=afcd93ebfca63623\" title=\"14-df-locally-connected-geometric-morphism\">14-df-locally-connected-geometric-morphism</a>实际刻画此概念；它不足以在一般基拓扑斯上定义局部连通。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}$ 见 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-locally-connected-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"afcd93ebfca63623","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 VII 讨论 essential geometric morphisms。仅存在 f_!⊣f* 的旧[[14-df-locally-connected-geometric-morphism]]实际刻画此概念；它不足以在一般基拓扑斯上定义局部连通。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsEssential}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\ (\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(L,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(L,f^*)).","display":true}],"bytes":987,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-237","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-essential-geometric-morphisms|Definition — 本质几何态射]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-essential-geometric-morphisms]]"},{"id":"afcd93ebfca63623","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"本质条件见 [[14-df-essential-geometric-morphisms]]，切片 Frobenius 比较见 [[14-df-indexed-frobenius-condition]]。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-essential-geometric-morphisms|Definition — 本质几何态射]]"}],"outgoing":["9752b779c5f463f9","d2b4e5cf16585f95","1f1269584b34ad4b","afcd93ebfca63623"]}